      "method": "Inspect every .c/.h/.s/.S file in the musl v1.2.5 git source tree and Zig 0.16.0 lib/libc/musl. Extract complete non-greedy /* ... */ comment blocks containing copyright, SPDX-License-Identifier, redistribution and use, permission is hereby, permission to use, public domain, or licensed under (case-insensitive). Deduplicate byte-identical comments; list sorted source paths for each block; sort blocks by first source path. Preserve comment bytes verbatim including delimiters."
