        }
      ],
      "method": "Inspect every .zig file under lib/c, lib/compiler_rt and lib/std/math in the pinned Zig archive. Extract consecutive full // comment lines containing copyright, licensed under, MIT/BSD licensed, public domain or a license URL (case-insensitive). Deduplicate byte-identical blocks; list sorted source paths for each block; sort blocks by first source path. Preserve comment bytes verbatim including delimiters."
